    "text": "A bar magnet has a magnetic moment equal to <math><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Wb</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. It is suspended in a magnetic field which has a magnetic induction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>T</mtext></math>. The magnet vibrates with a period of vibration equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>15&nbsp;s</mtext></math>. The moment of inertia of magnet is",
